py-chargemol

Copyright (c) 2025 by Thomas A. Manz. Rights reserved.
Python port copyright (c) 2026 Louie Slocombe.

py-chargemol is a Python reimplementation of the QDR program (version April 9,
2025) by Thomas A. Manz, which computes quadrupole-dipole resorbed (QDR) atomic
charges. As a derived work of that program, it is distributed under exactly the
same terms as the QDR program, reproduced below from section 5 of the QDR user
guide (QDR_program_04_09_2025/User_Guide_QDR_program_04_09_2025.pdf).

